  message: "WI-kufok (PR #1298, 2026-09-29) measured this item's population from the other side: of pretix's 1,122 attribute-receiver save/delete sites, ~1,060 are on models that OVERRIDE save (Order, Quota, Event, Device, Voucher; ~40 pretix models override save/delete), so they stay the external placeholder -- the ORM re-key correctly refuses them, and resolving them to the project override is this item's call-graph job. ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/kufok_09292026/RESULT.md."  # 270c
