  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/pyjs1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Fixture fx_lurob @100b6fbb6e: Payment.order = ForeignKey(Order, related_name='payments'); self.order.mark_paid() -> external:mark_paid with inherited_field_receiver='order' (a class-body field is not an own __init__ field, so Site-3 treats it as inherited and the linker finds nothing); control self.order.payments.create() -> django.db.models:create. relation_fields is still filled at py.py ~5605 and read only via the oracle. Since filing, WI-zamud added a third map (instance_field_types), so 'one fact, one home' now spans three maps. MECHANISM: DjangoRelationIndex.relation_fields is read only by the manager oracle; the Site-3 class field map (_collect_class_field_maps, __init__ only) never receives forward FK/O2O fields. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-zupiz,WI-nibum."  # 128d
